 <LayoutItem background="false" blendMode="0" excludeFromExports="0" frame="false" frameJoinStyle="miter" groupUuid="" halign="1" htmlState="0" id="" itemRotation="0" labelText="Carry a: USFS line is incomplete; published digitized&#xa;GPX supplies an approximate full passage.&#xa;Carries h and i: published sketches, no matching&#xa;USFS geometry. Water links f and m are not carries.&#xa;&#xa;Clearwater-Deer was omitted: the recorded trail&#xa;stops short of the lakes. Deer connects via Caribou.&#xa;&#xa;Rose is a terminal branch. Its T point, like those on&#xa;Deer, Alder and Crystal, is a hypothetical water&#xa;turnaround, not a campsite or landing." marginX="0" marginY="0" opacity="1" outlineWidthM="0.3,mm" position="277,153,mm" positionLock="false" positionOnPage="277,153,mm" referencePoint="0" size="139,66,mm" templateUuid="{a8477033-1d19-456f-9bc6-de16d3348fe2}" type="65641" uuid="{a8477033-1d19-456f-9bc6-de16d3348fe2}" valign="32" visibility="1" zValue="22">
